From b5c5245985bdea88136acdea62e14aeeb039a9f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felix Krueckel <hi@felkru.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 15:43:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 45/49] Notification body and an audible bell on the web

Web notifications now carry their body and respect play_sound, and the audible bell
asks the host page to play it (window.warpPanelBell), so the setting is offered on
the web too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
